    "cruise.routes.knossos.title": "Knossos & Heraklion History Tour",
    "cruise.routes.knossos.desc": "Visit the legendary Palace of Knossos, explore the Archaeological Museum of Heraklion, and walk through the historic city center with its Venetian architecture, lion fountain, and old harbor.",
    "cruise.routes.knossos.details": "Stops include the Palace of Knossos (1.5-2 hours), the Heraklion Archaeological Museum (1 hour), Morosini Fountain at Lions Square, the Venetian harbor, and a coffee break in the old town. Ideal for cruise ship passengers with limited port time. Your driver picks you up at Heraklion harbor and has you at Knossos within 20 minutes. Includes door-to-door transport in an air-conditioned Mercedes, bottled water, and local tips from your driver.",
