    "cruise.routes.beach.desc": "Escape to the stunning south coast of Crete. Visit the famous Matala beach with its hippie caves, the palm forest of Preveli, and the charming seaside village of Plakias.",
    "cruise.routes.beach.details": "The day begins with a scenic drive through the Messara Plain to the Minoan palace of Phaistos (optional stop, 45 minutes). Continue to Matala for swimming and a beachfront lunch among the ancient cliff caves. After Matala, head west along the coast to Preveli where a short hike leads to the famous palm beach. End the day in Plakias for a sunset drink before the drive home. Includes transport, bottled water, and flexible scheduling — stay longer at any stop you love.",
